Output examples/demo/out/filter.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 500
Set FontSize 22
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "cat examples/inputs/kaguya.txt | ./xylitol.sh filter --height=8"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Type "a"
Sleep 800ms
Type "k"
Sleep 1s
Backspace
Sleep 600ms
Backspace
Sleep 800ms
Type "ro"
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
